        "chars": 447,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.25
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        281,
        863,
        1480,
        1243
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. Of the members first appointed, the Chairperson shall be appointed for a term ending December 31, 1998; two of the members shall be appointed for terms ending December 31, 1997; and two of the members shall be appointed for terms ending December 31, 1996. Upon the expiration of such initial terms, all members shall be appointed for a term of four years. Vacancies occurring otherwise than by expiration of a term shall be filled for the unexpired term.",
